<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12242" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄπνοος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, 
			contr.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄπνους</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ουν</span>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>without wind, with but little air,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔαρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Epid.</u>
					3.2
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				361b6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				2.9.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>unventilated,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰκία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.515b
				</span></i>
			; <i>air-tight,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κώρυκος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Herod.
					8.74
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>breathless,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Theopomp.Com.
				71
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>lifeless,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				7.229
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Diosc.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				14.1787
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>without breathing</i> or <i>respiration,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Heraclid.Pont.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				72
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				75
			</span></i> Voss, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				492a13
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
